\b\f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43  What is meant by the term \hich\f43 \lquote \loch\f43 Just-in-Time\hich\f43 \rquote \loch\f43  Inventory system?
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\sb100\sa120\sl360\slmult0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 \cbpat8 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Ans 50)}{\rtlch\fcs1 
\af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
 Pull driven inventory system in which materials, parts, sub-assemblies, and support items are delivered just when needed and neither sooner nor later. Its objective is to eliminate pro\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
duct inventories from the supply. As much a managerial philosophy as an inventory system, JIT encompasses all activities required to make a final product from design engineering onwards to the last manufacturing operation. JIT systems are fundamentals to 
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 t\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
ime based competition and rely on waste reduction, process simplification, setup time and batch size reduction, parallel processing, and shop floor layout redesign. Under JIT management, shipments are made within rigidly enforced 'time windows\hich\f43 
\rquote \loch\f43  and all it\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 e\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 ms must be within the specification with very little or no inspection. It was developed and perfected by Taiichi Ohno of Toyota corporation during 1960s.

\par 
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43     }{\rtlch\fcs1 \ab\af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \b\f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Question No: 51    ( Marks: 5 ) 
