\b\f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 \hich\f43  Define the term \'93\loch\f43 \hich\f43 Material Management\'94\loch\f43 . What are the problems faced by material\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
s managers in today\hich\f43 \rquote \loch\f43 s world?
\par }\pard \ltrpar\ql \li0\ri0\nowidctlpar\wrapdefault\faauto\rin0\lin0\itap0 {\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 
\par \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 Ans 52) }{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 \f43\fs24\cf1\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
Material Management is concerned with control of materials in such a manner which ensures maximum return on working control. Material management is concerned with the location & purchase of needed their storage & movem\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
ent. It also arranges to keep an account for them. It is also responsible for planning their movement through manufacturing processes, store rooms and distribution channels. It is the branch of logistics that deals with the tangible components of a supply
\hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43  \hich\af43\dbch\af31505\loch\f43 
chain which covers the acquisition of spare parts/replacements, quality control of purchasing and ordering such parts/replacements, and the standards involved in ordering, shipping, and warehousing.}{\rtlch\fcs1 \af43\afs24 \ltrch\fcs0 
\f43\fs24\lang1033\langfe8192\langnp1033\insrsid8141396 
